   "evidence": "MappingSpace.lean:67 `private theorem exists_localSection_diffeomorph ... \u2203 U ... \u2203 s : M \u2192 M \u2243\u2098^m\u27eeI, I\u27ef M, ContinuousOn s U \u2227 \u2200 y \u2208 U, s y \u2022 x\u2080 = y`. Action.lean:277 `mappingSpaceEvalTrivialization_actionMap` takes `U hU s hs hsec` explicitly. The docstring of the new file cites it for `Diff(M)`.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Geometry/Diffeomorphism/MappingSpace.lean",
   "fix": "Make `exists_localSection_diffeomorph` public, with a non-private name such as `exists_localSection_diffeomorph_smul`. Alternatively, state a public theorem giving `U`, `s` and the chart identity `mappingSpaceEvalTrivialization_actionMap` for `Diff(M)`.",
   "issue": "`exists_localSection_diffeomorph` is `private`. The two public theorems expose only the existence of a trivialization, not the section `s` and open set `U` it is built from. The module docstring says that in these charts the action map `Diff(M) \u00d7 Map_*(B, M) \u2192 Map(B, M)` is the stabilizer action (`mappingSpaceEvalTrivialization_actionMap`). That theorem needs explicit `U`, `s`, `hs`, `hsec`, which no public declaration in this file provides. The map of fibrations for Layer 11 items 3 and 4 (Propositions 6.29 and 6.36) is exactly the consumer that needs them.",
   "line": 67
  }
